 "description": "Deterministic, no-LLM coding memory shared with other agents. Captures tool events into a keyed inspeximus store so a corrected fact supersedes the stale one and cannot be resurrected by an echo. Every write is signed with the agent that made it, so a file's timeline reads across Codex and Claude Code alike.",
